I'm 1000 percent sure that indie devs would be better at "marketing" if ;

--they reframed it as "showing your game to people who might like to play it" 

--instead of "I'm a sleazy salesman who is trying to sell you something you don't want"

@alan678.bsky.social has chosen #BirdsInTheirElement as today’s #BirdOfTheDay.
Here is a red kite in its element, searching for a meal. I took the photo in southeastern Germany, where there are many red kites. #birds
And on that note: happy Sunday to all birders out there!😊🙋‍♀️🪶
